<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Newbridge Networks cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Newbridge Networks cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it downgraded Newbridge Networks Corp to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst not available to comment.</p>
<p>-- NYSE listed shares fell 1-3/8 to 31-3/4 in midmorning exchange trading.</p>
